      "subject": "isemɣer aẓaẓ-is",
      "rationale": "הגדיל עקב — tigawt tasantikt: 'isemɣer aẓaẓ-is' anamek-is timtewwelin ɣef wayla; taɛbranit ur d-tesseqcam ara tigawt-nniḍen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "tifrat",
      "rationale": "שלומי d talɣa n usuddel: 'argaz n tifrat-iw' — mačči 'ameddakul' kan; talɣa n taɛbranit tettwasegges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "שלומי \/ שלום",
      "rationale": "SH-LOMI yettban am Yisem n Yiṣḥaq 'Shlomo' i d-yettwakksen seg LO-DAVID (2 Sam 11:1); timeḥrit-a tecbreḥ iman-is."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Ula d argaz n tifrat-iw, anida i tḥekkuɣ, win yeṭṭen aɣrum-iw, isemɣer aẓaẓ-is ɣef iyyi.",
